---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import { pageTitle } from '../lib/seo';
---
<BaseLayout title={pageTitle('Shipping and returns')} description={`Shipping costs €5, free on orders of ${site.freeShippingFrom} or more. Ships in ${site.shipsIn} with tracking, worldwide. 30-day returns.`}>
  <article class="container narrow prose">
    <header class="page-head"><h1>Shipping and returns</h1></header>

    <h2>Buying on this website</h2>
    <p>
      Shipping costs €5.00 per order, and it's free on orders of {site.freeShippingFrom} or more. We ship
      worldwide. Orders go out in {site.shipsIn} with tracking, and we email you the tracking number once your
      parcel is on its way.
    </p>
    <p>
      There are no import charges to pay on delivery to the EU, the UK or the US. The price you see at checkout is
      the full price. Other countries may charge their own import fees on arrival.
    </p>

    <h2>Returns</h2>
    <p>
      You can return any item within 30 days of delivery. You pay the return postage, and we refund the item
      price plus the original shipping within 14 days of receiving it back, or of you sending us proof of postage if
      that comes first. Full details, including how to
      cancel, are on our <a href="/terms/">terms of sale</a> page.
    </p>

    <h2>Buying on Etsy</h2>
    <p>
      Every piece here is also listed on our Etsy shop, if you would rather buy there. Etsy shows the shipping cost
      for your country before you pay. Returns on Etsy orders follow the policy shown on each Etsy listing. If
      something isn't right, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email.hello}`}>{site.email.hello}</a> or message us on
      Etsy and we'll sort it out.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
